      "text": "\u00a7 3. City agencies responsible for providing public improvements and services in the special designated areas, including the Economic Development Administration, the Housing and Development Administration, the Municipal Services Administration, the Parks and Recreation Administration, Cultural Affairs Administration, the Health Services Administration, the Environmental Protection Administration, the Transportation Administration, the Human Resources Administration, the Office of Neighborhood Services, Department of Civic Affairs and Public Events, the Fire Department and the Police Department shall cooperate with the Director of the Office of Development in the performance of his functions and duties as set forth herein. Each such agency shall keep the Office of Development advised of their ongoing and planned activities in the designated areas and shall coordinate such activities with those of the Office of Development. Upon the request of the Director, each such agency shall designate a staff member at policy level to be its liaison with the Office of Development and to cooperate in furnishing information and such available staff resources and professional services to the extent it is feasible to do so, as may be requested by the Director for performance of his functions and duties as set forth herein.",
